  '{1}',
  'Option B (Machine Learning is a subset of AI) is the correct answer. Artificial Intelligence is a broad field aiming to create intelligent machines, while Machine Learning is a specific approach within AI that enables systems to learn from data without explicit programming. Option A is incorrect as the hierarchy is the opposite. Option C is incorrect because they are distinct concepts, though related. Option D is incorrect; AI encompasses more than just rule-based systems and includes ML.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain5_1',
  NOW(),
  10,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_5_1',
  'easy'
