  '["Supervised Learning","Reinforcement Learning","Deep Learning","Unsupervised Learning"]'::json,
  '{3}',
  'Option D (correct) is Unsupervised Learning, which is used to find hidden patterns or intrinsic structures in unlabeled datasets. Grouping customer comments into categories without predefined labels is a classic clustering problem, a form of unsupervised learning. Option A (Supervised Learning) requires labeled data for training. Option B (Reinforcement Learning) involves an agent learning through trial and error in an environment. Option C (Deep Learning) is a subset of machine learning that uses neural networks, but it can be applied to both supervised and unsupervised tasks.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain5_1',
  NOW(),
  13,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_5_1',
  'medium'
) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;

