  'mcq',
  '["Supervised learning, characterized by labeled datasets.","Deep learning, a subset of machine learning utilizing multi-layered neural networks.","Reinforcement learning, focused on agent-environment interaction.","Classical machine learning, relying on simpler algorithms and extensive feature engineering."]'::json,
  '{1}',
  'Option B (correct) defines deep learning. Deep learning is a subset of machine learning that uses neural networks with multiple layers (deep neural networks) to learn complex representations from data, often excelling in tasks like image and speech recognition. Option A (Supervised learning) is a type of learning, not a network architecture. Option C (Reinforcement learning) is another learning paradigm. Option D (Classical machine learning) refers to traditional ML algorithms that typically require more manual feature engineering.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain5_1',
  NOW(),
  25,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_5_1',
