  'Option C (correct) is image generation, which is a generative AI modality specifically designed to create new images or visual content, often from text prompts. Option A, text generation, focuses on creating written content. Option B, audio generation, focuses on creating sounds or speech. Option D, code generation, focuses on producing programming code.',
