  '{1}'::int[],
  'Option B (correct) is a suitable choice for a vector store in RAG, as it provides vector search capabilities. Amazon S3 (Option A) is object storage, not a vector database. AWS Lambda (Option C) is a serverless compute service. Amazon EC2 (Option D) provides virtual servers, not a managed vector store service.',
