  '{1}'::int[],
  'Option B (correct) accurately describes the use of inference parameters. Temperature controls the randomness (creativity) of the output, while length limits control the maximum number of tokens generated. Option A describes fine-tuning. Option C describes model evaluation. Option D is not the primary purpose of inference parameters.',
