  '{1}'::int[],
  'Option B (correct) describes the primary purpose of agents, which are designed to enable foundation models to autonomously perform complex, multi-step tasks by breaking them down, reasoning, and calling external tools or APIs. Option A describes basic model interaction. Option C is about model customization. Option D is about model evaluation.',
