  '{2}'::int[],
  'Option C (correct) is the most important criterion. The model must have the capability for summarization and sentiment analysis, and given a startup''s typical constraints, cost-effectiveness is crucial. Option A is unnecessary if feedback is only in English. Option B is irrelevant for summarization. Option D might be overkill and lead to higher costs if feedback snippets are generally short.',
