VALUES (
  'q_7_m_7_1_41',
  'What is the primary benefit of using Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) with Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases in a foundation model application?',
  'mcq',
  '["To fine-tune the foundation model with proprietary data.","To ground model responses in specific, up-to-date, and authoritative data sources.","To reduce the model''s inference latency for real-time interactions.","To increase the model''s general knowledge about the world."]'::json,
  '{1}'::int[],
  'Option B (correct) highlights the core benefit of RAG: providing models with access to external, up-to-date information to generate grounded and accurate responses, reducing hallucinations. Option A describes fine-tuning, which is a different customization approach. Option C is not the primary benefit of RAG. Option D is achieved through pre-training, not RAG, which focuses on specific knowledge.',
