  '{0}'::int[],
  'Option A (correct) accurately describes the `temperature` parameter, which influences the randomness of the model''s output. Higher temperatures lead to more creative and diverse responses, while lower temperatures result in more deterministic and focused outputs. Option B is controlled by the `max_tokens` parameter. Option C is typically set via system prompts. Option D is handled by guardrails.',
