VALUES (
  'q_7_m_7_1_44',
  'A media company wants to generate short, creative ad copy variations from a large foundation model. They find the model often produces repetitive outputs. Which inference parameter should they adjust to encourage more diverse and imaginative text generation?',
  'mcq',
