  '{1}'::int[],
  'Option B (correct) is the appropriate action. Increasing the `temperature` parameter makes the model''s output more random and diverse, which is desirable for creative text generation. Option A would make the output even more repetitive. Option C would only make the output longer, not necessarily more diverse. Option D does not directly control the creativity or diversity of the output.',
