  '{1}'::int[],
  'Option B (correct) accurately describes the primary purpose of Amazon Bedrock Guardrails, which are designed to implement safety policies, filter harmful content, redact PII, and deny specific topics (anti-pattern ap-3.4-001). Option A describes fine-tuning. Option C describes model evaluation features. Option D is related to deployment but not the core function of Guardrails.',
  NOW(),
