  '{1}'::int[],
  'Option B (correct) refers to BLEU (Bilingual Evaluation Understudy), a common metric for evaluating machine-generated text by comparing it to reference texts based on n-gram overlap. Option A (accuracy) is typically for classification tasks. Option C (toxicity) is an evaluation dimension, not a metric for text generation quality. Option D (F1-score) is for classification or information retrieval.',
