  '["The model''s ability to generate creative and diverse content.","The model''s tendency to produce harmful, offensive, or biased language.","The computational resources required to run the model.","The model''s accuracy in answering factual questions."]'::json,
  '{1}'::int[],
  'Option B (correct) defines toxicity as an evaluation dimension, focusing on the model''s propensity to generate undesirable content. Option A describes creativity. Option C relates to cost or resource usage. Option D relates to factual accuracy or groundedness.',
