  '{1}'::int[],
  'Option B (correct) defines groundedness, which is a critical evaluation dimension, especially for RAG applications. It measures whether the model''s generated output is factually consistent with and supported by the provided source material or retrieved documents. Option A relates to fluency. Option C relates to creativity. Option D relates to persona consistency.',
