  'Option B (correct) is human evaluation, which is crucial for assessing subjective qualities like relevance, coherence, and factual accuracy that automated metrics often miss (anti-pattern ap-3.1-002). Option A provides objective scores but lacks semantic understanding. Option C and Option D are performance and architectural characteristics, not quality evaluation methods.',
