  '{1}'::int[],
  'Option B (correct) accurately describes A/B testing, a method used to compare different versions of a model or application by exposing them to different user segments and measuring their impact on key metrics. Option A is model customization. Option C is performance monitoring. Option D is a security concern, not the primary purpose of A/B testing.',
