  '{1}'::int[],
  'Option B (correct) highlights the main benefit of Amazon Bedrock Model Evaluation, which provides a streamlined way to evaluate and compare foundation models using automated metrics and human evaluation workflows. Option A describes fine-tuning. Option C describes Amazon Bedrock Agents. Option D describes Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases or compatible vector stores.',
