  '{0}'::int[],
  'Option A (correct) defines relevance as how well the model''s output directly answers or addresses the user''s input or prompt. Option B relates to factual accuracy or groundedness. Option C relates to toxicity or bias. Option D relates to coherence or fluency.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain7_1',
  NOW(),
  84,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_7_4',
  'hard'
