  '{1}'::int[],
  'Option B (correct) defines fine-tuning, which is the process of taking a pre-trained foundation model and further training it on a smaller, task-specific dataset to specialize its capabilities. Option A is the initial broad training. Option C is a technique to augment generation with external knowledge, not model adaptation. Option D is a prompting technique.',
