VALUES (
  'q_7_m_7_3_28',
  'What is a key characteristic of ''instruction tuning'' in the context of fine-tuning foundation models?',
  'mcq',
  '["It focuses on training the model to generate highly creative and imaginative content.","It involves fine-tuning the model on datasets formatted as instructions and desired responses to improve its ability to follow commands.","It is primarily used to reduce the model''s overall parameter count.","It requires a massive, unlabeled dataset for initial training."]'::json,
  '{1}'::int[],
  'Option B (correct) describes instruction tuning, a type of fine-tuning where models are trained on datasets consisting of instructions and corresponding desired outputs. This significantly enhances the model''s ability to understand and follow human commands. Option A is not the primary goal. Option C is incorrect; instruction tuning doesn''t reduce parameters. Option D describes pre-training data requirements.',
