  '{2}'::int[],
  'Option C (correct) accurately describes RLHF, which is a crucial step in aligning foundation models with human preferences, helpfulness, and safety by training a reward model from human feedback and then using reinforcement learning to optimize the language model. Option A is pre-training. Option B is an output formatting technique. Option D is an inference parameter adjustment.',
