  'Option D (Significant harm from unchecked AI errors) is a major risk in high-stakes domains. AI models can make errors, and without human oversight (human-in-the-loop patterns), these errors can lead to serious negative consequences in areas like healthcare or legal decisions. Options A, B, and C are less direct or universal consequences compared to the potential for harm.',
