  'Option C (Data bias) refers to biases that originate from the training data itself, such as underrepresentation of certain groups or historical prejudices reflected in the data. Option A (Algorithmic bias) arises from the design of the algorithm or model. Option B (Human oversight bias) is not a standard category of AI bias, though human decisions can introduce bias. Option D (Transparency bias) is not a recognized source of bias in this context.',
