  '{2}'::int[],
  'Option C (Human-in-the-loop oversight) is crucial for high-stakes decisions like medical diagnoses, ensuring human experts review and validate AI recommendations, providing accountability and error correction. This directly addresses the anti-pattern of deploying AI in high-stakes decisions without human oversight. Option A (Automated decision-making) is the opposite of what is needed here. Option B (Black-box model deployment) would make it harder to understand and correct errors. Option D (Data anonymization only) is important for privacy but does not address the need for human review in decision-making.',
