  '{1}'::int[],
  'Option B (To make AI decisions understandable to humans) is the primary purpose of Explainable AI (XAI) and model interpretability. It aims to provide insights into why an AI model made a particular decision. Option A (To increase model complexity) is incorrect; XAI often aims to simplify understanding, not increase complexity. Option C (To reduce training time for models) is not a direct goal of XAI. Option D (To automatically correct all model errors) is an overstatement; XAI helps identify errors but doesn''t automatically correct them.',
