VALUES (
  'q_8_m_8_1_88',
  'To detect and mitigate bias in AI models, particularly in high-stakes applications like employment screening, it is crucial to analyze the model''s behavior and feature attributions. Which AWS service provides tools for model interpretability and bias detection?',
  'mcq',
  '["AWS Audit Manager","Amazon Macie","Amazon SageMaker Clarify","Amazon Bedrock Guardrails"]'::json,
  '{2}'::int[],
  'Option C (Amazon SageMaker Clarify) is the correct service. It provides tools to help detect bias in ML models and datasets, and offers model interpretability features to understand how models make predictions. Option A (AWS Audit Manager) helps with compliance. Option B (Amazon Macie) is for sensitive data discovery. Option D (Amazon Bedrock Guardrails) is for generative AI content moderation.',
