  '{1}',
  'Option B (AWS KMS) is the correct service for managing cryptographic keys and performing encryption operations. It is commonly integrated with Amazon S3 to encrypt data at rest, including training data and model artifacts. Option A (AWS CloudTrail) records API calls and related events. Option C (Amazon VPC) provides network isolation. Option D (AWS IAM) manages access permissions, but not the encryption itself.',
