  '{1}',
  'Option B (AWS Config) is the correct service. It continuously monitors and records your AWS resource configurations and allows you to automate the evaluation of recorded configurations against desired configurations, helping with compliance and auditing. Option A (AWS CloudTrail) logs API calls. Option C (AWS KMS) manages encryption keys. Option D (Amazon VPC) provides network isolation.',
