  '{1}',
  'Option B (AWS Audit Manager) is designed to help you continuously audit your AWS usage and simplify how you assess compliance with regulations like GDPR. It automates the collection of evidence for audits, making it easier to demonstrate adherence to privacy policies and data processing activities. Option A (AWS IAM) manages access. Option C (Amazon SageMaker) is for building, training, and deploying ML models. Option D (Amazon Bedrock) is for building and scaling generative AI applications.',
