INSERT INTO public.question (id, text, type, options, correct_answer, explanation, created_at, quiz_id, modified_at, index, pairs, matches, module_id, difficulty)
VALUES (
  'q_9_m_9_2_55',
  'Which aspect is a critical consideration for deploying AI systems in regulated industries like healthcare or finance, often requiring specific legal and ethical adherence?',
  'mcq',
  '["Maximizing model inference speed at all costs","Minimizing training data volume regardless of impact on accuracy","Using only open-source AI models to avoid vendor lock-in","Adherence to industry-specific regulations and data privacy laws"]'::json,
  '{3}',
  'Option D (Adherence to industry-specific regulations and data privacy laws) is the most critical consideration. Regulated industries have stringent requirements (e.g., HIPAA for healthcare, GDPR/PCI DSS for finance) regarding data handling, privacy, and accountability, which AI systems must comply with. Option A (Maximizing inference speed) is a performance goal, not a compliance one. Option B (Minimizing training data) can negatively impact model performance. Option C (Using open-source models) is a technical choice that doesn''t inherently guarantee compliance.',
