  '{1}',
  'Option B (To enhance transparency, explainability, and accountability of AI models) is the correct reason. Comprehensive documentation provides insights into how models are built, what data they use, and how they perform, which is vital for understanding, auditing, and trusting AI systems, especially in regulated industries. Option A (Automatically improving performance) is not a direct function of documentation. Option C (Eliminating security measures) is incorrect and dangerous. Option D (Reducing deployment costs) is not the primary purpose of governance documentation.',
