  'mcq',
  '["AWS Config","Amazon Virtual Private Cloud (VPC)","AWS Key Management Service (KMS)","AWS CloudTrail"]'::json,
  '{3}',
  'Option D (AWS CloudTrail) is the correct service. AWS CloudTrail records API calls and related events for most AWS services, including Amazon SageMaker. This provides a detailed, immutable log of all actions taken on SageMaker notebooks, training jobs, and other resources, which is essential for security analysis, change tracking, and regulatory compliance audits. Option A (AWS Config) monitors resource configurations for compliance but doesn''t log API calls. Option B (Amazon VPC) is for network isolation. Option C (AWS KMS) manages encryption keys.',
