  '{1,4}'::int[],
  'Option B (correct) describes Amazon Q Business, which aims to improve business productivity by providing a conversational AI assistant that can answer questions and complete tasks using company data. Option E (correct) describes Amazon Q Developer, which assists developers by generating code, debugging, and explaining code. Option A (incorrect) is a capability more aligned with Amazon Bedrock or SageMaker. Option C (incorrect) is a broader capability offered by services like Amazon SageMaker or AWS Lambda. Option D (incorrect) is a function of Amazon SageMaker MLOps tools.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain6_1',
  NOW(),
  4,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_6_3',
