  '{1,3}'::int[],
  'Option B (Fairness) and Option D (Explainability) are two of the core dimensions of Responsible AI, alongside privacy, robustness, governance, and transparency. Option A (Scalability), Option C (Cost-effectiveness), and Option E (Performance) are important operational or model performance metrics, but they are not considered primary dimensions of Responsible AI itself.',
