  'Option A (Increased user trust and adoption), Option B (Meeting regulatory compliance requirements), and Option C (Improved model debugging and troubleshooting) are key benefits of implementing Explainable AI (XAI) and model interpretability. Understanding how a model works builds confidence, satisfies legal obligations, and helps developers identify and fix issues. Option D (Significantly reduced model training time) and Option E (Enhanced data storage efficiency) are not direct benefits of XAI; they relate to model optimization and infrastructure management.',
