  'Option A (Amazon SageMaker Clarify) is an AWS service specifically designed to provide model explainability and bias detection. Option B (Model interpretability) is the overarching concept that SageMaker Clarify helps achieve, focusing on understanding why a model makes certain predictions. Option C (Amazon Macie) is for sensitive data discovery. Option D (AWS Audit Manager) helps manage compliance. Option E (Amazon Bedrock Guardrails) is for generative AI safety and content moderation, not general ML model interpretability.',
  NOW(),
