  '{0,1}'::int[],
  'Option A (Focusing on user trust and understanding) and Option B (Providing actionable and relevant explanations) are key aspects of human-centered design for explainable AI. The goal is to make AI systems comprehensible and useful to human users. Option C (Automating all decision-making processes) goes against human oversight principles. Option D (Prioritizing model complexity for higher accuracy) can often hinder explainability. Option E (Minimizing human interaction with the AI system) is contrary to building trust and effective human-AI collaboration.',
