  'q_8_m_8_2_98',
  'A data science team is deploying a complex deep learning model on Amazon SageMaker for a critical application and needs to ensure its predictions are explainable to meet internal compliance requirements. Which two AWS tools or features can directly assist in achieving model explainability? (Select TWO.)',
  'multiple',
