  'Answering general questions about company policies (Option A) is a core capability of Amazon Q for retrieving information from internal documents. Summarizing complex reports and generating action items (Option C) represents a more advanced analytical and generative task for business productivity. Providing code suggestions and debugging assistance for developers (Option B) is a highly specialized use case, typically handled by Amazon Q Developer, focusing on developer-specific workflows and knowledge.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain6_1',
  NOW(),
  42,
