  'To get structured JSON output, first, Option D (Define the overall task for the model) sets the context. Then, Option C (Instruct the model to respond only in JSON) explicitly tells the model the desired format. Option A (Specify the required JSON schema or structure) provides the detailed structure. Lastly, Option B (Provide examples of JSON output if using few-shot) can further reinforce the structure, especially for complex schemas.',
