  '{2,0,1,3}'::int[],
  'Model selection begins with Option C (Determine the required modality and context window) to ensure the model supports the basic input/output types and length. Next, Option A (Evaluate the model''s performance on specific tasks) assesses its capability. Option B (Consider the cost per token and overall inference budget) is then evaluated for economic viability. Finally, Option D (Assess the model''s latency for real-time needs) is critical for user experience in interactive applications.',
