  '{2,0,3,1}'::int[],
  'When adjusting inference parameters for creative tasks, Option C (Set the `temperature` to influence randomness and creativity) is typically the first parameter to adjust for overall creativity. Then, Option A (Define `top_p` or `top_k` for diverse sampling) can be used to further refine the diversity of the generated tokens. Option D (Adjust the `max_tokens_to_sample` to control output length) controls the verbosity. Finally, Option B (Test the model''s output with the chosen parameters) is essential to validate the effects of these adjustments.',
