  'ordering',
  '["Analyze the Clarify output to understand feature importance and individual prediction explanations","Run the SageMaker Clarify job to generate explainability reports","Configure a SageMaker Clarify processing job, specifying inputs and desired explanations","Train and deploy the machine learning model in SageMaker"]'::json,
  '{3,2,1,0}'::int[],
  'To use Amazon SageMaker Clarify, the machine learning model must first be trained and deployed (Option D). Next, a SageMaker Clarify processing job is configured, defining the data inputs and the type of explanations required (Option C). The Clarify job is then executed (Option B) to generate the explainability reports. Finally, the output from Clarify is analyzed (Option A) to gain insights into model behavior, such as feature importance.',
