  '{1,3,0,2}'::int[],
  'The process begins with training the machine learning model (Option B). Once trained, feature importance scores are calculated (Option D) to quantify the impact of each input variable. Based on these scores, the most influential features are identified (Option A). Finally, these insights are used to either refine the model (e.g., feature selection) or to better understand its underlying decision-making behavior (Option C).',
