  'The sequence begins with the AI model making a prediction or decision (Option C). Following this, the user initiates a request for an explanation (Option B). An explanation generation module then processes the model''s decision and relevant inputs (Option A) to formulate the explanation. Finally, the user receives the generated explanation (Option D).',
