  NULL,
  'Source Documents are the raw, unstructured or semi-structured data that forms the knowledge base for RAG. Chunking is the process of dividing these documents into smaller, manageable segments to fit within an LLM''s context window and improve retrieval relevance. Embeddings are numerical vector representations created from these chunks, allowing for semantic similarity search in a vector database.',
