  NULL,
  'A Foundation Model (left: 0) is a large AI model trained on a vast amount of data, designed to be adaptable to a wide range of downstream tasks. A Large Language Model (left: 1) is a type of foundation model specifically trained on text data to understand and generate human language. A Token (left: 2) is the smallest unit of text or code that an LLM processes, such as a word, subword, or character.',
