  NULL,
  'Generative AI is a type of artificial intelligence capable of producing new content and ideas. A Foundation Model is a large AI model pre-trained on a vast quantity of data, which can be adapted to various downstream tasks. A Large Language Model (LLM) is a type of foundation model specifically designed to understand and generate human language, typically characterized by billions of parameters.',
