  NULL,
  'Prompt Engineering involves crafting effective input prompts to guide an LLM''s behavior without altering the model itself. Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) enhances LLM responses by fetching relevant information from external data sources. Fine-tuning is the process of further training a pre-trained foundation model on a specific dataset to adapt its weights and improve performance for a particular task.',
