  NULL,
  'Accuracy (left item 0) assesses the correctness of factual information generated by the model. Toxicity (left item 1) evaluates whether the model generates harmful, offensive, or inappropriate content. Relevance (left item 2) measures how pertinent and on-topic the model''s response is to the user''s query or the given context.',
