  NULL,
  'Amazon SageMaker Clarify (Option A) is specifically designed to generate bias and explainability reports for ML models. Amazon SageMaker Model Cards (Option B) are used to document essential model details, including performance, fairness metrics, and intended use, enhancing transparency. Amazon Macie (Option C) is primarily for discovering and protecting sensitive data for privacy, which is a related but distinct aspect of Responsible AI from direct model explainability.',
