  'matching',
  '{"A":"AWS CloudTrail","B":"Amazon Bedrock Guardrails","C":"Amazon SageMaker Role Manager"}'::json,
  NULL,
  'AWS CloudTrail (left item 0) provides a record of actions taken by a user, role, or an AWS service, which is vital for logging API calls (right item 0) and auditing security events in AI systems. Amazon Bedrock Guardrails (left item 1) is designed to implement safety policies and mitigate prompt injection (right item 1) and other content risks for foundational models. Amazon SageMaker Role Manager (left item 2) helps administrators define and manage fine-grained permissions for SageMaker users and resources, thereby streamlining SageMaker access (right item 2) securely.',
